## Algorithm

Start the program.
Read the number of users and friendships.
Create a graph using an adjacency list.
Add edges between users according to their friendships.
Select the starting user.
Initialize all users as unvisited.
Insert the starting user into the queue and mark it as visited.
Remove a user from the queue and display it.
Visit all its unvisited adjacent users and insert them into the queue.
Repeat steps 8 and 9 until the queue becomes empty.
Count the reachable users.
Display the users who remain unvisited.
Stop the program.
